===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|медвѣ́дь||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{word|ru|ine|médʰu}}
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*h₁ed-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|медвѣдь}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*medvědь}}. {{lit|one that eats mead/honey}}. Compare {{cog|ru|медое́д}}, composed of the same roots. Also compare {{cog|sa|मध्वद्||honey- or mead-eating}}.

Compare typologically {{m+|bg|лакомец||[[wolverine]]}}, {{m+|mk|лакомец||[[glutton]], [[wolverine]]}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|медве́дь}}
